From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pkgdemon <jpm820@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:45:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] NextBSD: loader splash, the logo without a still spinner

The loader painted spinner frame 0 under the logo, and it stayed still
until the kernel's own spinner started.  On a VM whose display is
virtio-gpu that waits for the display driver to attach (nextbsd-kernel
patch 0110), measured at about 2.6 s on the amd64 UTM VM, and a still
spinner looks like a hang.  The loader now paints the background and the
logo only; the kernel's first paint adds the spinner already turning, as
Apple's boot shows the logo first and the spinner once the system is
working.

Carried out-of-tree for NextBSD.
---
 stand/lua/loader.lua | 13 ++++++-------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/stand/lua/loader.lua b/stand/lua/loader.lua
index 2357b2f..61f61cb 100644
--- a/stand/lua/loader.lua
+++ b/stand/lua/loader.lua
@@ -71,9 +71,12 @@ end
 
 -- NextBSD boot splash, the boot.efi paint: in boot-video graphics mode,
 -- right after the console reaches the panel's native mode, paint the
--- bootsplash_style background, the centred NextBSD logo and spinner frame
--- 0 in one pass.  gfx.boot_splash() computes the geometry with the same
--- code as the boot_video record, so the kernel repaints the same pixels.
+-- bootsplash_style background and the centred NextBSD logo in one pass.
+-- gfx.boot_splash() computes the geometry with the same code as the
+-- boot_video record, so the kernel repaints the same pixels.  No spinner:
+-- the loader can't turn it, and a still one looks like a hang until the
+-- kernel starts it, which on a VM waits for the display driver.  The
+-- kernel's first paint adds it already turning.
 if core.isUEFIBoot() and gfx ~= nil and gfx.boot_splash ~= nil and
     loader.perform("boot-video is-graphics") == 0 then
 	local splash = gfx.boot_splash()
@@ -86,10 +89,6 @@ if core.isUEFIBoot() and gfx ~= nil and gfx.boot_splash ~= nil and
 			    splash.logo_x + splash.logo_w,
 			    splash.logo_y + splash.logo_h, 2)
 		end
-		-- spinner frame 0, in the style's spinner colour
-		local fg = splash.fg
-		gfx.fb_putmask(splash.spinner, splash.spin_x, splash.spin_y,
-		    (fg >> 16) & 0xff, (fg >> 8) & 0xff, fg & 0xff)
 	end
 end
 -- Our console may have been setup with different settings before we get
-- 
2.54.0 (Apple Git-157)

